### Valid message -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Cartman",
  "body": "Respect my authoritah!"
}

### Missing author -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Oh my God, they killed Kenny!"
}

### Empty body -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Kyle",
  "body": "   "
}

### Broken JSON -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "author": "Kenny"

### Wrong data type -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": 123,
  "body": "mmph mmph"
}